Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:24:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] linux: libremix.so links; headless platform extensions,
 export map, stubs

- libremix.so links on Linux x86_64 and exports only remixapi_* and
  remixinternal_* (linux/remix.map).
- Headless platform extension provider: VK_KHR_win32_surface is no longer
  requested on Linux, which would fail instance creation.
- XeSS SDK stubs, USD mod and capture UI stubs, SetProcessDPIAware.
- Explicit instantiation of DxvkContext::commitGraphicsState.
- remix_c.h includes stddef.h for wchar_t in C on non-Windows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tb41TgDi74v7sgH5LJBZ5A
Signed-off-by: Claude (for Kush) <kushisthecoolest@gmail.com>
---
 linux/remix.map                   |  9 ++++
 linux/src/dxvk_headless_exts.cpp  | 47 +++++++++++++++++++++
 linux/src/remix_usd_stubs.cpp     | 58 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 linux/stubs/remix_linux_stubs.cpp | 68 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 public/include/remix/remix_c.h    |  1 +
 src/d3d9/meson.build              |  2 +
 src/dxvk/dxvk_context.cpp         |  7 ++++
 src/dxvk/meson.build              |  3 ++
 8 files changed, 195 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 linux/remix.map
 create mode 100644 linux/src/dxvk_headless_exts.cpp
 create mode 100644 linux/src/remix_usd_stubs.cpp

diff --git a/linux/remix.map b/linux/remix.map
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..29a7cc0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/linux/remix.map
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+/* Exported symbols of libremix.so. Everything else, including the statically linked libstdc++, stays local
+   so it cannot interpose on other libraries in the host process (for example the JVM). */
+{
+  global:
+    remixapi_*;
+    remixinternal_*;
+  local:
+    *;
+};
